    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. i'll talk to the chef about the sign-off system. \n\none more thing - i'm also worried about the staff being too distracted or \"forgetful\" when things get chaotic during the actual service. do you have any tips for keeping the servers focused on the dietary labels and making sure they don't accidentally serve a nut dish to someone who asked for a vegan option?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
