      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To keep your servers focused during the chaos, you need a system that puts the responsibility on the *process*, not just on the individual server's memory. Have a dedicated \"Dietary Liaison\" or runner whose sole job is to monitor the service flow and answer specific guest questions about ingredients. Furthermore, equip your servers with small, laminated \"cheat cards\" corresponding to the buffet labels, reminding them of the key differentiators (e.g., \"Vegan = No Meat/Dairy/Honey,\" \"Nut Allergy = Avoid Green/Red Tag\"). This redundancy helps prevent errors when the pressure is high.",
      "source": "target",
